        <STYLE css="font-style:italic">profit</STYLE> me, in whom old <gr str="3624">age </gr>had <gr str="6">perished</gr>?</VERS>
      <VERS vnumber="3">For <gr str="2639">want </gr>and <gr str="3720">famine </gr>
