        <gr str="1565">solitary</gr>; <gr str="6207">fleeing </gr>into the <gr str="6723">wilderness </gr>in former <gr str="570">time </gr>
        <gr str="7722">desolate </gr>and <gr str="4875">waste</gr>. <DIV>
