        </DIV>
        <DIV>
          <NOTE type="x-studynote">in…: Heb. yesternight</NOTE>
        </DIV>
      </VERS>
      <VERS vnumber="4">Who cut <gr str="6998">up </gr>
        <gr str="4408">mallows </gr>by the <gr str="7880">bushes</gr>, and <gr str="7574">juniper </gr>
        <gr str="8328">roots </gr>
